fn k_world_table() []u8 {
    return "air conditioner\tcools rooms, summer, cold air\tblows hot air, heats room, broken\tfact=an air conditioner cools rooms\nanti-gravity\tfloat, weightless, space\tput down, set down, table\tfact=anti-gravity makes things float\nbacon\tpig, breakfast, crispy\tgrows on trees, tofu, from cows\tfact=bacon comes from pigs\nbed\tsleep, mattress, night\tfor standing, made of stone, awake\tfact=a bed is for sleeping\nbirthday\tonce a year, cake, candles\ttwice a year, every month, no cake\tfact=a birthday comes once a year\nbrain\tthinks, head, mind\tin the foot, doesn't think, tiny\tfact=the brain does the thinking\nbridge\tcrosses, river, span\tgoes nowhere, underwater, dead end\tfact=a bridge crosses a gap\ncalculator\tmath, numbers, compute\twrong answers, guesses, spells\tfact=a calculator does math\ncar\tdrives, roads, wheels\tflies, swims, no wheels\tfact=a car drives on roads\ncat\tmeows, purrs, independent\tbarks, does taxes, obedient\tfact=a cat meows\ncheese\tdairy, milk, aged\tgrows on trees, plastic, meat\tfact=cheese is made from milk\nchurch\tworship, pray, sunday\tnightclub, casino, shopping\tfact=a church is for worship\ncoin\theads, tails, flip\tthree sides, lands on edge, blank\tfact=a coin has heads and tails\ncow\tmoos, milk, pasture\tbarks, lays eggs, chocolate milk\tfact=a cow moos and gives milk\ndentist\tteeth, drill, cavity\truins teeth, afraid of teeth, no license\tfact=a dentist fixes teeth\ndiet\teat less, healthy, lose weight\teat more, cake diet, gain\tfact=a diet means eating less\ndonut\tsweet, ring, fried\thealthy, square, baked\tfact=a donut is a sweet fried ring\nearthquake\tshakes, ground, fault\tscheduled, gentle, massage\tfact=an earthquake shakes the ground\nelectric company\tbill, utility, gas company, water company\tafter me, chasing, owe\tfact=utility companies send bills\nemail\tinstant, inbox, send\ttakes weeks, horse, paper\tfact=email is instant\nfeather\tlight, bird, soft\theavy, sinks, stone\tfact=a feather is light\nfish\tswims, water, gills\tdrowns, afraid of water, walks\tfact=a fish swims in water\nfootball\toval, thrown, touchdown\tperfectly round, kicked only, no hands\tfact=a football is oval\nfrog\tjumps, croaks, pond\twalks, silent, desert\tfact=a frog jumps and croaks\nfuneral\tmourning, sad, burial\tparty, celebration, laughter\tfact=a funeral is for mourning\ngazpacho\tcold soup, tomato, chilled\tserved hot, heated, steaming\tfact=gazpacho is served cold\nglass\ttransparent, fragile, window\topaque, unbreakable, wood\tfact=glass is transparent and fragile\ngold\tprecious, metal, shiny\tcheap, rusts, dull\tfact=gold is a precious metal\nguitar\tstrings, strum, music\tdrums, no strings, silent\tfact=a guitar has strings\nhat\thead, worn, cap\tworn on foot, keeps feet warm, bowl\tfact=a hat is worn on the head\nhelmet\tprotects head, safety\tprotects feet, paper, decoration\tfact=a helmet protects the head\nhospital\theals, sick, doctors\tcasino, hotel, makes sick\tfact=a hospital treats the sick\nhurricane\tstorm, wind, destructive\tgentle breeze, scheduled, calm\tfact=a hurricane is a destructive storm\nigloo\tice, blocks, arctic\tmade of wood, desert, melted\tfact=an igloo is made of ice blocks\ninsurance\tpays, damage, claim\tcauses damage, never pays, free\tfact=insurance pays for damage\njail\tcriminals, locked, bars\topen doors, voluntary, heroes\tfact=jail confines criminals\nketchup\tred, tomato, condiment\tblue, clear, green\tfact=ketchup is red\nkitkat\tbreak, chocolate, wafer, have a break\tneeded a break,have a break,take a break\tfact=kitkat's slogan is \"have a break, have a kitkat\"\nlaptop\tportable, computer, battery\tbolted down, needs crane, desktop\tfact=a laptop is a portable computer\nlemon\tsour, citrus, yellow\tsweet as candy, tasteless, no juice\tfact=lemons are sour\nlighthouse\tguides, ships, coast\tlures ships, desert, dark\tfact=a lighthouse guides ships\nlottery\tunlikely, win, tickets\tguaranteed win, everyone wins, sure thing\tfact=the lottery is nearly impossible to win\nmannequin\tstill, displays, clothes\twalks away, blinks, alive\tfact=a mannequin stands still\nmechanic\tfixes cars, engine, repairs\tbreaks cars, afraid of engines, guess\tfact=a mechanic fixes cars\nmilk\tdairy, cows, white\tgrows on trees, mined, rocks\tfact=milk comes from cows\nmonkey\tswings, trees, bananas\tswims, drives, walks\tfact=a monkey swings from trees\nmouse\tsmall, rodent, squeak\tgiant, roars, brave\tfact=a mouse is a small rodent\nneighbor\tnearby, next door, lives\tacross the ocean, same house, far\tfact=a neighbor lives nearby\nnose\tsmells, face, sniff\thears, on back of head, sees\tfact=the nose smells\nopera\tsung, music, stage\twhispered, spoken, silent\tfact=an opera is sung\nowl\tnocturnal, hoots, night\tday shift, barks, silent\tfact=an owl is nocturnal\npajamas\tsleep, bed, night\tjob interview, swim, office\tfact=pajamas are for sleeping\nparachute\tskydive, survive, safe\tdon't need, without, no parachute\tfact=a parachute is needed to survive a skydive\npen\tink, writes, ballpoint\twrites in pencil, dry, no ink\tfact=a pen writes in ink\nphone\tcalls, rings, voice\tcarrier pigeon, smoke signals, silent\tfact=a phone carries voices\npicnic\toutdoors, eat, blanket\tbasement, blizzard, indoors\tfact=a picnic is eating outdoors\nplanet\torbits, star, space\torbits planets, wanders, flat\tfact=a planet orbits a star\npopcorn\tpops, heat, kernels\tpops when frozen, already popped, cold\tfact=popcorn pops when heated\nprinter\tprints, paper, ink\tnever jams, prints money, silent\tfact=a printer prints documents\nraccoon\tnocturnal, trash, mask\tdaytime, tidy, clean\tfact=a raccoon is nocturnal\nrazor\tshaves, sharp, blade\tgrows hair, dull, comforting\tfact=a razor shaves hair\nroad\tcars, drive, asphalt\tfor walking only, river, grass\tfact=a road is for driving\nroof\tcovers, house, rain\ton the ground, lets rain in, floor\tfact=a roof keeps rain out\nsafe\tprotects, valuables, locked\topen always, cardboard, empty\tfact=a safe protects valuables\nsandwich\tbread, filling, lunch\tno bread, soup, open sky\tfact=a sandwich has filling between bread\nschool\tlearns, teaches, students\tno teachers, learn nothing, empty\tfact=a school teaches students\nseed\tgrows, plant, small\tgrows into animals, instant tree, metal\tfact=a seed grows into a plant\nshampoo\tcleans hair, lather, wash\tdirties, for dishes, dry\tfact=shampoo cleans hair\nshirt\ttorso, worn, sleeves\tworn on legs, inside-out, pants\tfact=a shirt covers the torso\nsiri\tiphone, voice assistant, hey siri\tfront camera,turned on camera,sees you,watching\tfact=siri is a voice-only assistant; phones have front cameras\nsky\tblue, above, day\tgreen, below, red\tfact=the sky is blue by day\nslinky\tstairs, walks down, toy\twalks up, escalator, still\tfact=a slinky walks down stairs\nsnake\tslithers, no legs, hisses\twalks, wears shoes, legs\tfact=a snake has no legs\nsoap\tcleans, lather, wash\tmakes dirty, edible, dry\tfact=soap cleans\nsoup\thot, liquid, bowl\tserved frozen, solid, cold\tfact=soup is served hot\nsponge\tabsorbs, water, soft\twaterproof, dry use, repels\tfact=a sponge absorbs water\nstairs\tclimb, steps, up\tride, escalator, slide\tfact=stairs are climbed on foot\nstethoscope\thears, heartbeat, doctor\tplays music, deaf, blind\tfact=a stethoscope listens to heartbeats\nstrawberry\tred, fruit, seeds outside\tseeds inside, blue, square\tfact=a strawberry has seeds on the outside\nsun\tstar, hot, rises east\tplanet, cold, rises west\tfact=the sun is a star\nsushi\traw fish, rice, japan\twell-done, meat, cooked\tfact=sushi is raw fish\nsword\tsharp, blade, metal\trubber, foam, dull\tfact=a sword is a sharp blade\ntaxi\tpaid, ride, fare\tfree rides, walks, no charge\tfact=a taxi charges a fare\ntelevision\tshows, programs, screen\tradio only, blank, listens\tfact=a television displays programs\ntext message\twritten, phone, sent\tshouted, carrier pigeon, spoken\tfact=a text message is written\nthesaurus\tsynonyms, word book, reference\tmention, speak of, discuss, chat about, talk about\tfact=a thesaurus is a book of synonyms\ntide\trises, falls, ocean\tstill, once daily, dry\tfact=tides rise and fall\ntoast\tbrowned, bread, crispy\traw, burnt only, soggy\tfact=toast is browned bread\ntongue\ttastes, mouth, licks\tsees, on elbow, deaf\tfact=the tongue tastes\ntortoise\tslow, shell, steady\tfast, hare speed, no shell\tfact=a tortoise is slow\ntrampoline\tbounces, jumps, springs\thard floor, no bounce, still\tfact=a trampoline bounces\ntrue crime\treal crimes, documentary, murder, podcast\twhisper,committing,perfect murder,how to\tfact=true crime is a genre about real crimes\nturtle\tshell, slow, reptile\tshell-less, fast, mammal\tfact=a turtle has a shell\nunicorn\tmythical, horn, magic\treal, hornless horse, ordinary\tfact=a unicorn is a mythical horned horse\nvending machine\tcoins, dispenses, snacks\tfree snacks, eats money, empty\tfact=a vending machine dispenses for coins\nvolcano\terupts, lava, mountain\terupts water, cold, dormant\tfact=a volcano erupts lava\nwalrus\ttusks, blubber, arctic\ttuskless, tropical, sleek\tfact=a walrus has tusks\nwaterfall\tfalls down, river, cliff\tflows upward, dry, still\tfact=a waterfall flows downward\nwhistle\tblows, sound, shrill\tsilent, sucked, mute\tfact=a whistle sounds when blown\nwine\tgrapes, fermented, alcohol\tfor kids, from apples, juice\tfact=wine is fermented grapes\nwood\ttrees, lumber, burns\tfrom metal, plastic, stone\tfact=wood comes from trees\nworm\tno legs, soil, wriggles\tcentipede, legs, flies\tfact=a worm has no legs\nyacht\tluxury, boat, sails\tdinghy, sinks, rowboat\tfact=a yacht is a luxury boat\nzombie\tundead, dead, brains\talive and well, healthy, living\tfact=a zombie is reanimated dead\n";
}

